Now that PCBoard is available in a DOS and OS/2 environment, it is helpful
to know which PPL commands are specific to one operating environment or the
other.  The purpose of this document is to briefly list which statements
are specific and what environment they are specific to.  For descriptions of
the statments or functions listed, refer to the PPLC manual.

 Command             Specific To
 -----------------   -----------------
 DOINTR              DOS
 MKADDR              DOS
 PEEKW               DOS
 PEEKDW              DOS
 PEEKB               DOS
 POKEW               DOS
 POKEDW              DOS
 POKEB               DOS
 REG...              DOS
 SOUND               Emits a 1/4 second tone under OS/2.
 VAROFF              DOS
 VARADDR             DOS
